dsytFk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8f1B82NHX_L_K8P4H2XsDrIXUnnVT5OnEukzU7I6EMA&oe=6B006EE7"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "197205785051646", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12533786_1192162547567637_3368213769858580480_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U3zbAy9DF-wQ7kNvwGNXVj5&_nc_oc=AdrTwc3js3JDk_omkcv-5bYE84kXjYA3v8Spa8ig0oqrNnh-O42Metrd_iqGyE1DPCg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3cUG5zquDiDU11ketXqwe1EICSXwJjDNbLz6NhnOZJA&oe=6B006926"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Sneaky Bears RollerCoaster", "keywords": ["roller", "coaster", "rollercoaster", "fast", "fly"], "long_description": "Ever wanted to try a DOUBLE LOOP on a Roller Coaster, but have been too afraid to try? Now you can\u2026while sitting in your living room!\n\nWith three crazy journeys, each at a different intensity level, you can try out the coaster through the fantastical Sneaky Bears toy factory. There\u2019s something here for everyone.\n\nNo matter how adventurous you\u2019re feeling, we have the coaster for you. We\u2019re BEARY excited!\n\nFor more on the toy factory and bears, feel free to try out our game Sneaky Bears.\n\nWe hope you like the experience and if you do, please don\u2019t forget to give us a review. Bon Voyage!", "short_description": "Ever wanted to try a DOUBLE LOOP on a Roller Coaster, but have been too afraid to try? Now you can\u2026while sitting in your living room!\n\nWith three crazy journeys, each at a different intensity level, you can try out the coaster through the fantastical Sneaky Bears toy factory. There\u2019s something here for everyone.\n\nFor more on the toy factory and bears, feel free to try out our game Sneaky Bears!\n\nWe hope you like the experience and if you do, please don\u2019t forget to give us a review. Bon Voyage!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope